ame><given-names>FH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genistein inhibits NF-kappa B activation in prostate cancer cells</article-title><source>Nutr Cancer</source><year>1999</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>167</fpage><lpage>174</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10693171</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1207/S15327914NC352_11</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Cao</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Weng</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Xing</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Song</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Zhou</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Effect of tumor suppressor gene PTEN on the resistance to cisplatin in human ovarian cancer cell lines and related mechanisms</article-title><source>Cancer Lett</source><year>2008</year><volume>271</volume><fpage>260</fpage><lpage>271</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18657898</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.canlet.2008.06.012</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>El-Rayes</surname><given-names>BF</given-names></name><name><surname>Ali</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Ali</surname><given-names>IF</given-names></name><name><surname>Philip</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Abbruzzese</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Sarkar</surname><given-names>FH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Potentiation of the effect of erlotinib by genistein in pancreatic cancer: the role of Akt and nuclear factor-kappaB</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>66</volume><fpage>10553</fpage><lpage>10559</l